DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: MARTIN MARIETTA MATERIALS INC (MLM)\nRoadshow: Website: www.netroa
 dshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=82dbd315 | Passcode: MLM2026 (not case-sensiti
 ve)\n\nDeal context:\nMartin Marietta Materials\, Inc. (MLM)\, rated Baa2 
 (Negative Watch) / BBB+ (Negative) / BBB+ (Negative) by Moody's\, S&P\, an
 d Fitch respectively\, has mandated Goldman Sachs\, J.P. Morgan\, Deutsche
  Bank Securities\, and Truist Securities to arrange fixed income investor 
 calls on Monday\, August 10th\, ahead of a potential benchmark senior unse
 cured fixed-rate USD SEC registered offering. The deal is expected to span
  maturities ranging from 3 to 30 years\, with the number and sizing of tra
 nches to be determined subject to market conditions. No pricing terms have
  been disclosed at this stage\, as this is a pre-deal mandate announcement
  with investor calls scheduled before formal bookbuilding commences.
